		<item>
		<title>「流行り神1」数据库资料翻译 File No.001 “蓝血”</title>
		<link>/2011/09/11/hayarigami-database-001/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[岡崎鏡]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sat, 10 Sep 2011 17:40:26 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[翻译]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[avg]]></category>
