<p><a href="/2011/08/16/psp-tsukumonogatari-clear-impressions/">《付丧物语》（つくものがたり）通关(补充剧本感想)</a>最先出现在<a href="/">終ノ空</a>。</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p><strong>《付丧物语》（つくものがたり）</strong>通关。<br>没有什么亮点的游戏，喜欢这类民俗风主题的可以玩下……战斗系统比较鸡肋，剧情平淡，但人设非常不错，声优阵容也异常强大……<br>CG只打了77%，有空有闲了再补完吧，一周目无法快进，二周目可以快进已读部分。<br><br>对于剧本，有三点想说（微透请自行反白）<br><span style="color: #ffffff;">一是这么多女主竟然没有一个可攻略的。- -都只是友情以上恋人未满的暧昧感觉，真是……</span><br><span style="color: #ffffff;">虽然这些妹子都对男主有意思，但男主似乎对她们没意思？</span><br><span style="color: #ffffff;">二是学妹的死莫名其妙，看了下日站的攻略，似乎男主的其中一个基友也会死，但不管是谁挂掉都好奇怪，也没什么实感……剧本作者不会想用这样的剧情来赚眼泪吧。= =</span><br><span style="color: #ffffff;">三是最后手机里的那只怪跑出来说，她是妖界来的什么老大一类妖怪的分身，要给世界带来灾难清洗人类之类的，但对于这样的一个真正的BOSS，男主跟她真正对峙的时间连一章都不到……真正展开的部分太单薄了点</span><br>不过这AVG要是当作校园休闲剧来看还是不错的，妹子们的声音也很好听（<br>最大乐趣就是看别人吐槽男主，特别是手机里的那只付丧神，超可爱！<br>先放一张最喜欢的角色伊狩惠美奈（CV：钉宫理惠）的CG。<br><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-123 size-full" src="http://www.kagami.biz/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/1290281293258524730.jpg" alt="1290281293258524730" width="480" height="272" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/1290281293258524730.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/1290281293258524730-300x170.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px" /><br>然后就是其他的CG啦（男主是人生赢家无误）<br><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-128 size-full" src="http://www.kagami.biz/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2866822637814911109.jpg" alt="2866822637814911109" width="480" height="272" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2866822637814911109.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2866822637814911109-300x170.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px" /><br><a href="http://www.kagami.biz/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2536652490133311007.jpg"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-124 size-full" src="http://www.kagami.biz/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2536652490133311007.jpg" alt="2536652490133311007" width="480" height="272" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2536652490133311007.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2536652490133311007-300x170.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px" /></a><br><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-121 size-full" src="http://www.kagami.biz/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/605734149898211197.jpg" alt="605734149898211197" width="480" height="272" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/605734149898211197.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/605734149898211197-300x170.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px" /><br><a href="http://www.kagami.biz/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2583940286220701302.jpg"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-125 size-full" src="http://www.kagami.biz/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2583940286220701302.jpg" alt="2583940286220701302" width="480" height="272" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2583940286220701302.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2583940286220701302-300x170.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px" /></a><br><a href="http://www.kagami.biz/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2838675140143846533.jpg"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-126 size-full" src="http://www.kagami.biz/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2838675140143846533.jpg" alt="2838675140143846533" width="480" height="272" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2838675140143846533.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2838675140143846533-300x170.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px" /></a><br><a href="http://www.kagami.biz/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2847963814375296538.jpg"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-127 size-full" src="http://www.kagami.biz/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2847963814375296538.jpg" alt="2847963814375296538" width="480" height="272" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2847963814375296538.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2847963814375296538-300x170.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px" /></a><br>&nbsp;<br><strong>制品情报</strong><br>ジャンル アドベンチャーRPG<br>対応機種 プレイステーション?ポータブル (PSP)<br>発売元 フリュー<br>人数 1人<br>メディア UMD<br>発売日 2011年1月27日<br>価格 6,090円（税込）<br>官方网站：http://www.cs.furyu.jp/tsukumono/index.html</p>



